# ── Per-arm training checkpoints (intermediate compute state) ────────
# Written by scripts/train_models.py so an interrupted run resumes instead
# of restarting. Machine state, not evidence — the reportable outputs are
# results/p1/model_training.* and the persisted arms in artifacts/models/.
Research_Artifact/code/artifacts/checkpoints/

# ── Replay part files (resumable intermediate state, DL-023 §6) ──────
# Written by scripts/run_replay.py, one per (strategy, grid point). The
# reportable output is the assembled results/p2/sample_run/decisions.csv.gz.
Research_Artifact/code/artifacts/replay_parts/

# ── Replay decision traces (large, deterministically regenerable) ────
# 61 MB per run. Not tracked by author decision at the P2-T4 gate
# (2026-09-24); the sha256, determinism check and validator result are
# tracked beside it, and REGENERATE.md gives the command. Pinned, not stored.
Research_Artifact/results/p2/sample_run/decisions.csv.gz
Research_Artifact/results/p2/policy_fit/decisions.csv.gz
# P3-T2 test-trace records (~14M rows). Not tracked (DL-028 §4); sha256 pinned in
